          {
            "title": "Question: Using table aliases 2",
            "id": 98908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questa query?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie.title \" /><text value=\"AS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie, director.name \" /><text value=\"AS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" director\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie \" /><text value=\"AS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" m\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INNER\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"JOIN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" director \" /><text value=\"AS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" d\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ON\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" m.director_id = d.id;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non usa gli alias delle tabelle quando accede alle colonne nell'istruzione <code>SELECT</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Crea alias per le tabelle, cosa non consentita</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non sta usando gli alias delle tabelle nella condizione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non usa gli alias delle tabelle quando accede alle colonne nell'istruzione <code>SELECT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La query assegna a <code>movie</code> l'alias <code>m</code> e a <code>director</code> l'alias <code>d</code>. Quali riferimenti devono cambiare affinché la query venga eseguita?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie.title \" /><text value=\"AS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie, director.name \" /><text value=\"AS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" director\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie \" /><text value=\"AS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" m\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INNER\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"JOIN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" director \" /><text value=\"AS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" d\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ON\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" m.director_id = d.id;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I riferimenti alle colonne in <code>SELECT</code> devono usare <code>m</code> e <code>d</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gli alias devono essere rimossi da <code>FROM</code> e <code>JOIN</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo la condizione <code>ON</code> deve smettere di usare gli alias</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">L'istruzione <code>SELECT</code> deve usare insieme nomi e alias delle tabelle</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I riferimenti alle colonne in <code>SELECT</code> devono usare <code>m</code> e <code>d</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
